  "details": "In VRChat build 1565, neither of my 2 pcs (RTX 3090 and RTX 2080 Max Q) displays Enlighten Global Illumination indirect lighting in uploaded worlds on the live branch, whether in PC or VR mode. The lighting works correctly in the editor and during local testing, and other players report it functions as intended.  \n\nTroubleshooting steps attempted (unsuccessful):\n\n1. Reset VRChat settings by deleting registry entries.  \n\n2. Reinstalled VRChat.  \n\n3. Restored NVIDIA driver settings to defaults.  \n\n4. Reinstalled GPU drivers.  \n\n5. Rolled back to older driver versions.\n\nTest World:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_2c644820-1548-4a10-a520-0221635f3349",
